# AI Email Assistant

## Project Overview

The AI Email Assistant is a Python-based application developed to automate written communication tasks. It uses an OpenAI-compatible API to rewrite informal email messages into polite and professional communication.

The application accepts email text, constructs a parameterized prompt, sends it to the configured chat model, and prints the rewritten email.

## Objectives

- Initialize an OpenAI client using the provided API credentials and base URL.
- Create a function named `rewrite_email(text: str) -> str`.
- Construct a prompt that requests polite and professional rewriting.
- Send the prompt to the specified chat model.
- Retrieve and print the generated email response.

